        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Related to https://github.com/neovim/neovim/discussions/41723. Although this script can't properly add preview for `:normal` by itself, since it would also require filtering out `:normal` commands that do more than just basic editing. That would require some way of parsing a string of Normal mode commands into atoms, similar to `nvim_parse_cmd()` but for Normal mode commands.\n\nNevertheless, some sort of preview autogenerator script would likely be a stepping stone to adding preview support to a wider range of commands.",
